chensted.getD_map_pred","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecordingOfSYT.lean#L93-L99","doc":"Reading an entry commutes with the shift — including past the end, where the default `0` is\nalready a fixed point of `(· - 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.unshiftT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.unshiftT","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecordingOfSYT.lean#L88-L91","doc":"**Shift every entry down by one.** The inverse of `shiftT` on a tableau of positive entries;\nit turns a standard tableau's `1`-based filling into the `0`-based timestamps the recording\nmachinery counts in. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.pos_of_mem_flatten_toListTableau","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.pos_of_mem_flatten_toListTableau","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecordingOfSYT.lean#L83-L86","doc":"Every entry is positive — the hypothesis the down-shift needs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.mem_flatten_toListTableau_iff_Icc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.mem_flatten_toListTableau_iff_Icc","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecordingOfSYT.lean#L71-L81","doc":"**The entries are exactly `1, …, |μ|`** — both directions of the filling's bijectivity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.mem_flatten_toListTableau","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.mem_flatten_toListTableau","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecordingOfSYT.lean#L49-L69","doc":"**The entries are the image of the cells.** ","signatureChunk":0}]}